@startuml
title Device Gateway — Сценарий 3: Управление соединением (keepalive, переподключение, backoff)

participant "Устройство" as Dev
participant "Device Gateway" as GW
participant "Device Registry" as DR

== Первичное подключение ==
Dev -> GW: Connect (TLS)\n(device_id, creds)
GW -> GW: Проверить креды
GW -> DR: UpdatePresence(device_id, Online, last_seen=now)
DR --> GW: OK
GW --> Dev: Connected

== Keepalive ==
loop Каждые N секунд
  Dev -> GW: Ping / Heartbeat
  GW -> DR: UpdateLastSeen(device_id, now)
  DR --> GW: OK
  GW --> Dev: Pong
end

== Обрыв связи ==
alt Соединение закрыто корректно
  Dev -> GW: Disconnect
  GW -> DR: UpdatePresence(device_id, Offline, last_seen=now)
  DR --> GW: OK
else Таймаут / пропали heartbeat
  GW -> GW: Detect timeout
  GW -> DR: UpdatePresence(device_id, Offline, last_seen=now)
  DR --> GW: OK
end

== Переподключение ==
Dev -> Dev: Backoff (1s, 2s, 4s, ...)
Dev -> GW: Reconnect (TLS)
GW -> DR: UpdatePresence(device_id, Online, last_seen=now)
DR --> GW: OK
GW --> Dev: Connected
@enduml